WEBVTT

01:14.140 --> 01:18.780
[Meet Yourself]

01:20.040 --> 01:23.880
[Episode 19]

01:33.526 --> 01:36.116
Yao, sleep early.

01:37.806 --> 01:39.615
Granny, don't worry about me.

01:39.616 --> 01:40.746
Go to sleep.

03:17.562 --> 03:18.642
Help!

03:19.032 --> 03:20.401
Spider, don't come here.

03:20.402 --> 03:21.622
Don't come here.

03:22.592 --> 03:23.561
Go over there.

03:23.562 --> 03:24.812
Don't come over here.

03:27.522 --> 03:28.602
Don't come...

03:28.722 --> 03:29.778
Don't.

03:29.802 --> 03:31.282
Brother.

03:34.832 --> 03:36.002
Don't come over here.

03:39.322 --> 03:40.582
Don't come over here.

03:42.192 --> 03:43.272
Go aside.

03:46.282 --> 03:47.962
Hu, what's wrong?

03:48.242 --> 03:49.521
Big grasshopper.

03:49.522 --> 03:50.192
Don't come over.

03:50.192 --> 03:50.721
You...

03:50.722 --> 03:51.802
Back off.

03:53.282 --> 03:54.961
You... You've drunk too much.

03:54.962 --> 03:56.042
Don't come over.

03:56.682 --> 03:57.762
Hu.

04:01.592 --> 04:02.672
Damai.

04:02.992 --> 04:04.072
Don't come over.

04:04.342 --> 04:05.512
What's wrong, Damai?

04:05.852 --> 04:07.911
The snake and grasshopper are together.

04:07.912 --> 04:09.792
Hongdou!

04:10.192 --> 04:12.722
Hongdou, get some help!

04:25.272 --> 04:26.642
Nana, what's wrong?

04:30.122 --> 04:30.762
Don't cry.

04:30.763 --> 04:31.922
I'll be right over.

04:50.322 --> 04:51.402
Quack.

04:55.002 --> 04:56.082
Quack.

05:07.122 --> 05:09.831
Every year, many families are carried in.

05:09.832 --> 05:10.881
If they're lucky,

05:10.882 --> 05:13.051
they get stomach and intestinal bleeding,

05:13.052 --> 05:14.761
and walk out on their own when they get well.

05:14.762 --> 05:16.751
If they are unlucky,
they will be carried out

05:16.752 --> 05:18.361
in the way of being carried in.

05:18.362 --> 05:19.831
Dare to eat the unfamiliar

05:19.832 --> 05:21.391
wild mushrooms on the mountain.

05:21.392 --> 05:22.962
How many lives do people have?

05:23.322 --> 05:24.611
Yes.

05:24.612 --> 05:26.571
Must pay attention in the future.

05:26.572 --> 05:27.571
With this lesson,

05:27.572 --> 05:29.061
they may not dare to eat mushrooms

05:29.062 --> 05:29.862
in the near future.

05:29.863 --> 05:31.031
Sorry to bother you so late.

05:31.032 --> 05:32.532
Thank you for your hard work.

05:41.592 --> 05:42.672
Quack.

05:45.352 --> 05:46.432
Quack.

05:47.232 --> 05:48.312
Quack.

05:49.872 --> 05:51.102
Quack.

05:52.432 --> 05:53.111
Hu.

05:53.112 --> 05:54.192
Quack.

05:54.432 --> 05:55.842
What are you looking for?

05:57.112 --> 05:58.902
There are frogs on their beds.

06:13.722 --> 06:15.251
Lie down quickly.

06:15.252 --> 06:16.562
Don't touch me, dirty.

06:29.722 --> 06:30.802
Nana,

06:31.012 --> 06:32.081
go back to rest.

06:32.082 --> 06:33.532
I'll keep an eye on it here.

06:33.892 --> 06:35.011
It's dawn now.

06:35.012 --> 06:36.392
Xiaochun will come over.

06:36.722 --> 06:37.882
It doesn't matter.

06:38.452 --> 06:41.122
I'm just worried about them.

06:42.582 --> 06:44.431
Their symptoms are mild.

06:44.432 --> 06:45.991
Every year there are a few cases.

06:45.992 --> 06:47.072
It's normal.

06:48.072 --> 06:49.792
I won't dare to eat mushrooms.

06:50.432 --> 06:51.391
You won't.

06:51.392 --> 06:52.942
You'll forget in a few days.

07:01.662 --> 07:04.942
[Dali City, Luoxia Town Health Center]

07:39.312 --> 07:40.392
How is Hongdou?

07:42.662 --> 07:43.991
She sweated so much,

07:43.992 --> 07:45.472
she must feel uncomfortable.

07:58.952 --> 08:03.842
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

08:06.172 --> 08:11.152
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

08:13.272 --> 08:19.872
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

08:27.792 --> 08:28.872
Everyone,

08:29.832 --> 08:31.432
I'm back.

08:41.152 --> 08:42.232
Hu.

08:44.552 --> 08:45.632
Damai.

08:48.072 --> 08:49.152
Dou.

08:53.702 --> 08:54.782
Hei.

08:55.622 --> 08:56.702
Hei.

08:58.432 --> 09:00.592
I'm asking you, where are they?

09:03.982 --> 09:05.142
You only know eating.

09:07.502 --> 09:08.102
Mushrooms.

09:08.103 --> 09:10.341
I fried them with ham last night.

09:10.342 --> 09:11.221
I know them all.

09:11.222 --> 09:12.981
I didn't see any poisonous ones.

09:12.982 --> 09:14.831
Then the lurid bolete was undercooked.

09:14.832 --> 09:15.831
No wonder.

09:15.832 --> 09:17.242
Luckily, it's not serious.

09:19.272 --> 09:20.221
How is it?

09:20.222 --> 09:20.861
They are fine.

09:20.862 --> 09:22.312
They've gone back to rest.

09:23.312 --> 09:24.271
Luckily, they're fine.

09:24.272 --> 09:25.341
Otherwise, how would you

09:25.342 --> 09:27.221
explain to their father, right?

09:27.222 --> 09:28.432
Yes.

09:29.182 --> 09:31.791
Is there not enough
staff in the cafe today?

09:31.792 --> 09:32.741
Yes.

09:32.742 --> 09:34.781
Chuchu and Granny Caiyun have gone to Xiaguan

09:34.782 --> 09:35.911
for old granny's birthday.

09:35.912 --> 09:37.671
She asked me to cover for her.

09:37.672 --> 09:39.551
There are Hongdou
and Nana in the cafe.

09:39.552 --> 09:40.771
I think we have enough staff.

09:40.772 --> 09:44.112
This accident makes it worse.

09:45.152 --> 09:47.712
Is Hongdou going
back in a while?

09:48.382 --> 09:50.411
You need to recruit
people for your cafe,

09:50.412 --> 09:51.752
otherwise, it won't work.

09:52.502 --> 09:53.791
Yes.

09:53.792 --> 09:55.592
Our service has to keep up.

09:56.192 --> 09:57.631
As soon as the rain stopped,

09:57.632 --> 09:59.031
our Zeqing went to the mountains

09:59.032 --> 10:00.662
to pick mushrooms,

10:00.952 --> 10:03.312
and rolled a body of mud.

10:04.432 --> 10:05.551
The mushrooms are

10:05.552 --> 10:07.641
accepted by all the restaurants outside.

10:07.642 --> 10:10.232
If I sell them to restaurants,
I can earn money.

10:13.582 --> 10:16.461
They did not cook the
mushrooms themselves,

10:16.462 --> 10:17.581
and got poisoned.

10:17.582 --> 10:19.382
So I should not be blamed, right?

10:21.702 --> 10:24.022
Aunt Gui, don't
take it personally.

10:24.432 --> 10:25.742
It's just an accident.

10:26.272 --> 10:27.592
I know.

10:28.462 --> 10:30.232
I won't take it personally.

10:30.912 --> 10:32.382
I didn't do the poisoning.

10:33.032 --> 10:34.112
Yes.

10:35.382 --> 10:38.551
But they've just been poisoned,

10:38.552 --> 10:40.382
so their stomachs are weak.

10:40.862 --> 10:43.431
Fish soup with tofu
and millet congee

10:43.432 --> 10:45.192
are the best antidotes.

10:48.102 --> 10:48.831
Oh, no!

10:48.832 --> 10:49.671
Put it down.

10:49.672 --> 10:50.862
It can't be eaten.

10:51.102 --> 10:52.831
This plate has been cut with mushrooms,

10:52.832 --> 10:53.741
and not washed well,

10:53.742 --> 10:55.392
which can also cause poisoning.

10:56.702 --> 10:58.191
It's not that serious.

10:58.192 --> 11:01.902
Aunt Gui, no one
really blames you.

11:02.432 --> 11:04.952
I know.

11:05.222 --> 11:06.652
It should be washed clean.

11:08.552 --> 11:09.782
Now I'm relieved.

11:12.742 --> 11:13.822
Mr. Ma.

11:15.152 --> 11:16.341
You went back this time.

11:16.342 --> 11:17.931
How are your parents?

11:17.932 --> 11:19.862
Thanks to your blessing, they're fine.

11:20.862 --> 11:23.352
Did you tell them about your business?

11:39.102 --> 11:40.008
What?

11:40.032 --> 11:40.671
You...

11:40.672 --> 11:41.902
Say it again.

11:43.862 --> 11:45.752
I still want to start my own business.

11:46.982 --> 11:48.741
But it's not the same as before,

11:48.742 --> 11:50.232
I want to do industry.

11:52.152 --> 11:53.742
Told us earlier.

11:54.952 --> 11:55.861
God bless.

11:55.862 --> 11:56.831
God bless.

11:56.832 --> 11:58.142
Mom and Dad,

11:58.622 --> 12:00.472
I'm a little confused

12:00.832 --> 12:02.782
by your attitude.

12:03.702 --> 12:05.022
Damned Ma,

12:05.312 --> 12:07.551
I told you that I
gave birth to my son,

12:07.552 --> 12:08.941
I know him clearly.

12:08.942 --> 12:13.071
He's at Xie Zhiyao's
house holding a big move.

12:13.072 --> 12:14.621
Why can't you sleep at night,

12:14.622 --> 12:16.551
tossing, turning and sighing?

12:16.552 --> 12:17.982
I was scared by you.

12:18.222 --> 12:19.501
I didn't scare you.

12:19.502 --> 12:21.312
It was Ma who scared me.

12:22.102 --> 12:23.182
Dad,

12:23.272 --> 12:24.861
why did you say that?

12:24.862 --> 12:27.151
Why did you panic?

12:27.152 --> 12:28.951
Two days ago, when you came home,

12:28.952 --> 12:30.501
as soon as you entered the door,

12:30.502 --> 12:32.311
some words were written on your face,

12:32.312 --> 12:33.351
something is wrong.

12:33.352 --> 12:35.011
After you put down your things,

12:35.012 --> 12:37.441
you did the laundry,
cooked, mopped the floor,

12:37.442 --> 12:38.982
and cleaned the windows.

12:39.382 --> 12:41.472
You cleaned everything
inside and out.

12:43.012 --> 12:44.551
It's not worth mentioning.

12:44.552 --> 12:46.502
I'm just doing my filial duty.

12:47.382 --> 12:49.911
Your filial piety
scared us to death.

12:49.912 --> 12:52.832
We've been afraid
to breathe these days.

12:53.312 --> 12:55.621
Your father said,
it's obvious that

12:55.622 --> 12:57.271
you've decided to become a monk,

12:57.272 --> 12:59.022
and now you're back to inform us.

13:00.382 --> 13:02.621
Just tell us that you
want to start a business.

13:02.622 --> 13:03.902
It's not a big deal.

13:04.742 --> 13:05.951
Your father and I

13:05.952 --> 13:07.701
are not afraid that you will fail,

13:07.702 --> 13:09.551
but that you will be beaten down,

13:09.552 --> 13:10.832
and never recover.

13:11.582 --> 13:13.011
You sit in the sun

13:13.012 --> 13:14.782
with your legs crossed every day,

13:15.342 --> 13:17.782
which scares us.

13:18.342 --> 13:19.432
Put your legs down.

13:20.152 --> 13:21.352
Put them down.

13:22.432 --> 13:23.151
Put them down.

13:23.152 --> 13:23.921
We're eating.

13:23.922 --> 13:25.912
We don't want to smell your stinky feet.

13:26.242 --> 13:27.791
I've been a vegetarian lately.

13:27.792 --> 13:28.861
It's not stinky.

13:28.862 --> 13:29.701
Eat the food.

13:29.702 --> 13:31.191
It's getting cold.

13:31.192 --> 13:33.621
Tell us more about
your business project.

13:33.622 --> 13:34.951
Okay.

13:34.952 --> 13:36.352
Let me tell you about it.

13:37.192 --> 13:39.382
Look, I'm right.

13:40.192 --> 13:43.022
Parents all over the
world feel the same way,

13:43.272 --> 13:45.112
not afraid of children tossed,

13:45.382 --> 13:48.861
but like a puddle of
mud which is hopeless.

13:48.862 --> 13:49.942
Aunt Gui,

13:50.072 --> 13:51.981
you're truly an expert.

13:51.982 --> 13:53.472
Don't praise me.

13:54.102 --> 13:54.792
Peel the garlic.

13:54.792 --> 13:55.872
Okay.

14:00.182 --> 14:01.742
Slowly. Watch the threshold.

14:02.622 --> 14:03.861
I'm not that weak.

14:03.862 --> 14:04.831
You're weak.

14:04.832 --> 14:06.141
You're almost on the floor.

14:06.142 --> 14:06.981
Come on.

14:06.982 --> 14:08.062
Slowly.

14:09.452 --> 14:10.532
Slow down.

14:13.032 --> 14:15.061
These days, be
careful with your diet.

14:15.062 --> 14:16.862
Breaking your
stomach is serious.

14:17.982 --> 14:19.062
Put this on.

14:20.912 --> 14:22.551
I'm not that serious.

14:22.552 --> 14:23.052
Put it on.

14:23.052 --> 14:24.132
Do as you're told.

14:27.582 --> 14:29.191
Don't eat recklessly in the future.

14:29.192 --> 14:30.272
Look,

14:30.532 --> 14:31.741
this is cooked by Aunt Gui,

14:31.742 --> 14:33.101
which is good for digestion.

14:33.102 --> 14:34.862
Take a good rest for a few days.

14:35.742 --> 14:36.822
You're back.

14:37.032 --> 14:38.381
Did you get the money?

14:38.382 --> 14:39.592
Of course.

14:41.552 --> 14:44.552
My parents left me
the money to marry.

14:45.982 --> 14:47.412
How did you convince them?

14:47.982 --> 14:49.782
Before we just made a mistake.

14:50.192 --> 14:51.431
Misunderstanding.

14:51.432 --> 14:53.262
They always thought that

14:53.552 --> 14:55.281
I was going to be a monk.

14:55.282 --> 14:56.271
Then we made it clear.

14:56.272 --> 14:58.221
I said I want to start a new business.

14:58.222 --> 14:59.432
They were very happy.

14:59.792 --> 15:01.592
I see.

15:02.952 --> 15:04.341
How much money did your parents

15:04.342 --> 15:05.911
leave for you to get married?

15:05.912 --> 15:07.741
You're a miser who cares about this.

15:07.742 --> 15:09.192
You're already like this.

15:10.102 --> 15:11.502
I'm curious.

15:12.552 --> 15:14.072
It's a small amount of money

15:14.342 --> 15:16.712
to start a business.

15:17.102 --> 15:19.621
But it's mainly a
token of heart, right?

15:19.622 --> 15:22.861
I'm charging ahead,
and the back is stable.

15:22.862 --> 15:23.942
Yes.

15:24.522 --> 15:25.671
Don't talk about that.

15:25.672 --> 15:27.071
Take good care of her.

15:27.072 --> 15:28.552
I have to see Hu.

15:29.342 --> 15:32.072
He is scratching holes
everywhere, very serious.

15:33.032 --> 15:34.101
Thank you.

15:34.102 --> 15:35.432
Don't be polite.

15:38.102 --> 15:39.432
Have you noticed that

15:40.032 --> 15:41.552
Mr. Ma is different?

15:42.342 --> 15:44.112
Strength makes people confident.

15:44.692 --> 15:46.862
Maybe this is what
he looked like before.

15:47.502 --> 15:48.582
Frantic,

15:48.622 --> 15:51.221
arrogant, and don't
care about others.

15:51.222 --> 15:52.302
Disgusting.

15:55.152 --> 15:56.581
Eat those things.

15:56.582 --> 15:58.031
They are Aunt Gui's heart.

15:58.032 --> 15:59.741
She must be feeling bad.

15:59.742 --> 16:00.982
It's not her fault.

16:05.102 --> 16:07.502
Did you print out all the
photos taken by Damai?

16:10.152 --> 16:12.432
Print me a copy.

16:13.672 --> 16:15.072
What do you need them for?

16:15.302 --> 16:17.102
Then why did you print them out?

16:17.342 --> 16:18.422
I'll use them.

16:21.422 --> 16:24.072
How many birds are
there under your roof?

16:24.302 --> 16:26.242
Some more have been hatched yesterday.

16:30.002 --> 16:31.902
When did you make a photo wall?

16:33.832 --> 16:35.262
Our agreement.

16:38.482 --> 16:39.562
Well...

16:39.862 --> 16:40.552
Just photos.

16:40.553 --> 16:41.831
Nothing to look at.

16:41.832 --> 16:42.838
What?

16:42.862 --> 16:44.581
Why are there my photos?

16:44.582 --> 16:45.791
What's in them?

16:45.792 --> 16:47.271
This is my privacy.

16:47.272 --> 16:48.352
Please respect.

16:50.602 --> 16:51.032
Come on.

16:51.033 --> 16:52.572
Taking care of us all night,

16:52.912 --> 16:54.581
you haven't had a good rest.

16:54.582 --> 16:55.431
Go to have a rest.

16:55.432 --> 16:56.512
Slowly.

16:57.482 --> 16:59.551
When you're done eating,
remember to text Ma

16:59.552 --> 17:01.262
and ask him to clean it for you.

17:02.032 --> 17:03.078
I know.

17:03.102 --> 17:03.711
Bye bye.

17:03.712 --> 17:04.072
Bye bye.

17:04.073 --> 17:05.852
♫ A few hidden heartbeats ♫

17:07.772 --> 17:10.942
♫ Fill whose dream ♫

17:14.992 --> 17:16.072
Chang,

17:16.552 --> 17:17.902
did you go to cut barley?

17:18.142 --> 17:19.222
Yes.

17:20.902 --> 17:23.551
When are you going to Yang?

17:23.552 --> 17:24.871
Just in a few days.

17:24.872 --> 17:27.311
When I get back,
I'll bring you seafood.

17:27.312 --> 17:28.311
Don't bring that.

17:28.312 --> 17:29.762
We can't get used to it.

17:30.552 --> 17:31.621
Okay, bye.

17:31.622 --> 17:33.031
I'm bringing Zeqing some food.

17:33.032 --> 17:34.112
Okay.

17:40.102 --> 17:41.182
Hao.

17:41.352 --> 17:42.321
Aunt Gui, you're here.

17:42.322 --> 17:43.211
It's time to eat.

17:43.212 --> 17:45.102
I'll eat as soon as I finish chopping.

17:48.032 --> 17:49.112
Zeqing,

17:49.832 --> 17:50.791
here's the food.

17:50.792 --> 17:51.872
Okay.

17:53.832 --> 17:54.661
Hurry up.

17:54.662 --> 17:55.728
I'm coming.

17:55.752 --> 17:56.581
Come here.

17:56.582 --> 17:57.662
Okay.

18:12.622 --> 18:15.581
I'm so scared of what
happened this morning.

18:15.582 --> 18:18.142
My heart was pounding
all the way here.

18:19.032 --> 18:21.101
It's not easy for
parents to raise a child.

18:21.102 --> 18:22.831
If something bad happens here,

18:22.832 --> 18:24.382
we can't even explain it.

18:24.942 --> 18:26.112
Luckily, it's fine.

18:27.212 --> 18:28.551
Don't think too much about it.

18:28.552 --> 18:29.802
I tell you,

18:30.042 --> 18:32.051
don't talk too much
when you get to Qingdao.

18:32.052 --> 18:34.312
Don't tell Yang and Xi about this.

18:34.662 --> 18:37.272
If they know it, they
will blame me again.

18:37.942 --> 18:39.462
I won't say it.

18:45.272 --> 18:46.352
Yang.

18:49.312 --> 18:50.392
Yang.

18:51.382 --> 18:52.662
Have you eaten?

18:54.312 --> 18:56.071
I'm not home.

18:56.072 --> 18:57.031
I'm at the horse farm.

18:57.032 --> 18:58.552
Bring your father some food.

19:00.182 --> 19:01.902
We are good.

19:03.752 --> 19:05.702
Yang, I tell you that

19:05.942 --> 19:07.141
it rained several days ago,

19:07.142 --> 19:08.521
the mushrooms are growing well.

19:08.522 --> 19:09.871
They're growing in clutches.

19:09.872 --> 19:11.301
As soon as it stopped raining,

19:11.302 --> 19:12.721
your dad went up to the mountains,

19:12.722 --> 19:13.921
and picked a lot of fimbriae,

19:13.922 --> 19:14.901
and dried mushrooms.

19:14.902 --> 19:16.381
I've fried them all for you.

19:16.382 --> 19:19.222
I'll bring them to Xi and you.

19:19.862 --> 19:21.422
Listen to me.

19:21.752 --> 19:23.861
I made one more.

19:23.862 --> 19:26.341
Take it to your
leader to have a taste.

19:26.342 --> 19:27.422
Okay?

19:29.102 --> 19:30.382
You say.

19:36.662 --> 19:37.742
Why?

19:40.552 --> 19:41.632
What?

19:46.662 --> 19:47.742
I'm not going

19:47.992 --> 19:50.462
with your father, right?

19:51.512 --> 19:52.102
But you...

19:52.103 --> 19:54.142
You've booked the flight tickets.

19:56.582 --> 19:57.662
You can return it?

20:03.512 --> 20:05.381
No.

20:05.382 --> 20:07.471
I'm not unhappy. No.

20:07.472 --> 20:09.032
Your work is important.

20:09.312 --> 20:11.341
Your father and I
can always go there

20:11.342 --> 20:12.622
whenever we want.

20:13.342 --> 20:15.422
Your work is important, right?

20:16.382 --> 20:17.711
Okay.

20:17.712 --> 20:18.512
We won't go.

20:18.513 --> 20:19.662
Next time.

20:20.182 --> 20:21.592
Work hard.

20:21.902 --> 20:22.901
Okay.

20:22.902 --> 20:23.711
No more talking.

20:23.712 --> 20:24.512
You go on working.

20:24.512 --> 20:25.592
Hang up.

20:25.862 --> 20:27.272
I'll send the mushrooms

20:27.552 --> 20:29.382
to you two.

20:30.662 --> 20:31.711
Okay.

20:31.712 --> 20:32.688
Okay.

20:32.712 --> 20:33.551
Okay. Bye.

20:33.552 --> 20:34.342
You go on working.

20:34.342 --> 20:35.422
Hang up.

20:39.232 --> 20:40.942
It's wired.

20:42.832 --> 20:44.002
He doesn't let us go?

20:44.512 --> 20:45.511
He said that the leader

20:45.512 --> 20:47.032
asked him to go on business.

20:49.032 --> 20:50.382
It happens every time.

20:51.832 --> 20:53.792
The plane tickets are booked.

20:55.032 --> 21:00.861
He's busy.

21:00.862 --> 21:01.941
Being busy is good.

21:01.942 --> 21:02.901
Forget it.

21:02.902 --> 21:04.341
Being busy is good.

21:04.342 --> 21:06.991
What about the mortgage
for such a big house?

21:06.992 --> 21:08.512
He must be busy.

21:10.832 --> 21:12.032
Right.

21:12.312 --> 21:14.942
Well... Let's go next time.

21:15.382 --> 21:16.622
Don't feel sad.

21:17.182 --> 21:19.112
I don't.

21:19.832 --> 21:21.272
Work is important.

21:23.032 --> 21:24.312
What leader?

21:24.992 --> 21:26.662
The tickets have been bought.

21:27.422 --> 21:28.512
Negative comment.

21:28.752 --> 21:29.832
All right.

21:32.792 --> 21:33.952
Wired.

21:38.312 --> 21:39.512
To be honest,

21:39.792 --> 21:41.992
I don't want to go at all.

21:43.032 --> 21:45.831
Even though the fields
have been contracted out,

21:45.832 --> 21:49.112
Zeqing and I still have
serious jobs, right?

21:49.752 --> 21:52.711
If the kids hadn't called,

21:52.712 --> 21:56.791
and bought plane tickets,
I wouldn't have gone.

21:56.792 --> 21:57.872
Yes.

21:57.992 --> 21:59.101
That's right.

21:59.102 --> 22:00.702
But that's work.

22:00.972 --> 22:02.031
When there is a problem,

22:02.032 --> 22:03.191
as soon as the leader asks,

22:03.192 --> 22:04.922
you have to go on a business trip.

22:05.272 --> 22:06.621
Yes.

22:06.622 --> 22:07.902
That's it.

22:11.382 --> 22:12.462
Feng,

22:14.752 --> 22:17.371
don't go to the
courtyard this time.

22:17.372 --> 22:18.751
When I go to Qingdao next time,

22:18.752 --> 22:20.142
I'll let you know.

22:20.622 --> 22:22.582
Fine, you don't have to tell me.

22:22.832 --> 22:24.722
After a while, you
go to someone else.

22:26.272 --> 22:27.352
Are you angry?

22:30.342 --> 22:31.422
She is angry.

22:33.142 --> 22:35.312
I asked you to take me to the courtyard

22:35.832 --> 22:37.662
before you leave

22:37.902 --> 22:39.621
to teach me how to clean.

22:39.622 --> 22:40.992
You refused.

22:41.512 --> 22:43.382
It made me come twice.

22:43.712 --> 22:46.312
It's only 50 yuan a day.

22:46.752 --> 22:48.551
I can earn that money by weaving basket

22:48.552 --> 22:49.902
at home with my husband.

22:51.422 --> 22:52.552
Feng,

22:53.102 --> 22:54.661
I didn't mean to.

22:54.662 --> 22:57.142
It's an accident.

22:58.422 --> 22:59.862
Accident?

23:05.622 --> 23:06.702
Feng.

23:12.552 --> 23:14.721
Are you going to tell
me you don't care about

23:14.722 --> 23:16.182
that 50 yuan?

23:18.072 --> 23:19.561
I see your family in trouble,

23:19.562 --> 23:20.811
when there is something good,

23:20.812 --> 23:22.032
I always think of you.

23:22.312 --> 23:23.861
Are you thinking of me,

23:23.862 --> 23:25.382
or are you making me unhappy?

23:25.792 --> 23:27.841
How could?

23:27.842 --> 23:30.272
If you want to show
off, just go to show off.

23:31.182 --> 23:33.831
My life is bad, but my family

23:33.832 --> 23:36.072
is not as poor as you think.

23:36.592 --> 23:39.511
You don't have to
advertise for me every day,

23:39.512 --> 23:41.231
telling it to the people you meet.

23:41.232 --> 23:42.381
No need.

23:42.382 --> 23:44.311
What do you mean by that?

23:44.312 --> 23:45.071
Nothing.

23:45.072 --> 23:46.681
If there is nothing
else, just leave.

23:46.682 --> 23:47.551
I'm still at work.

23:47.552 --> 23:48.581
I'm busy.

23:48.582 --> 23:49.662
I won't leave.

23:49.832 --> 23:51.551
What do you mean by nothing?

23:51.552 --> 23:52.791
Please explain it clearly.

23:52.792 --> 23:53.382
Stop.

23:53.383 --> 23:54.471
What's the situation?

23:54.472 --> 23:55.831
Why are you angry?

23:55.832 --> 23:56.552
No.

23:56.553 --> 23:58.901
Xiaochun, what she's saying.

23:58.902 --> 24:00.381
What is showing off?

24:00.382 --> 24:01.581
What is publicity?

24:01.582 --> 24:02.941
What am I promoting?

24:02.942 --> 24:03.582
It's the truth.

24:03.582 --> 24:04.101
What?

24:04.102 --> 24:05.941
What am I bad for you?

24:05.942 --> 24:07.901
Say it clearly
what you just said.

24:07.902 --> 24:09.831
Don't be sarcastic.

24:09.832 --> 24:10.661
Others do not know,

24:10.662 --> 24:12.352
but we know each other very well.

24:12.792 --> 24:15.112
When Yang failed the
college entrance exam,

24:15.752 --> 24:19.381
you refused to let him re-read,

24:19.382 --> 24:20.941
saying he could only

24:20.942 --> 24:23.112
get a normal job after four more years.

24:23.662 --> 24:24.791
You wanted him to drive

24:24.792 --> 24:26.341
after graduating from high school.

24:26.342 --> 24:28.031
I tried my best to persuade you.

24:28.032 --> 24:31.072
Otherwise, your
Yang is just a driver.

24:31.422 --> 24:36.511
And Xi, you forced
her to study accounting.

24:36.512 --> 24:38.711
She has ignored
you for many years.

24:38.712 --> 24:41.141
She calls me and
asks me everything.

24:41.142 --> 24:42.491
Have you forgotten all of these?

24:42.492 --> 24:44.031
What does 800 years ago

24:44.032 --> 24:45.901
have to do with the present?

24:45.902 --> 24:47.111
You're so funny.

24:47.112 --> 24:47.622
All right.

24:47.623 --> 24:49.211
You... You're just jealous.

24:49.212 --> 24:51.201
You don't want others
to live better than you.

24:51.202 --> 24:52.702
All right, Aunt Gui,

24:53.032 --> 24:54.311
we are still working.

24:54.312 --> 24:55.661
Don't you have to cook at home?

24:55.662 --> 24:56.742
Go home now.

24:57.232 --> 24:58.312
Xiaochun,

24:58.832 --> 25:00.901
look what she's become now.

25:00.902 --> 25:02.521
To be honest, she's
not as nice to me

25:02.522 --> 25:03.612
as she used to be.

25:04.272 --> 25:05.981
Yang is concerned about me,

25:05.982 --> 25:07.181
afraid that I will be tired,

25:07.182 --> 25:09.161
so he doesn't let me
take care of the child.

25:09.162 --> 25:11.151
But she says that
Yang dislikes that

25:11.152 --> 25:12.661
I can not take care of the child.

25:12.662 --> 25:13.551
It's true.

25:13.552 --> 25:15.271
I'm just better off than you.

25:15.272 --> 25:17.751
You only have one son, Xie Qiang,

25:17.752 --> 25:19.341
who is still in jail.

25:19.342 --> 25:21.271
Don't show off here.

25:21.272 --> 25:22.861
Don't mention Xie Qiang.

25:22.862 --> 25:24.271
You know I don't eat mushrooms,

25:24.272 --> 25:26.141
you still gave mushrooms to us.

25:26.142 --> 25:26.552
Aunt Gui.

25:26.553 --> 25:27.751
Are you crazy?

25:27.752 --> 25:28.232
All right.

25:28.232 --> 25:28.712
Go.

25:28.713 --> 25:29.901
Are you crazy?

25:29.902 --> 25:30.831
Don't eat mushrooms.

25:30.832 --> 25:31.912
Why?

26:07.582 --> 26:10.971
Aunt Gui really has no
control over her mouth.

26:10.972 --> 26:13.102
She can't remember
what she said herself.

26:13.552 --> 26:15.471
Aunt Baoping also said a lot.

26:15.472 --> 26:18.101
Such as don't be
like that Xie Qiang

26:18.102 --> 26:19.581
who steals and goes to jail.

26:19.582 --> 26:22.581
Yes, every time she
says that, I blame her.

26:22.582 --> 26:24.832
Aunt Feng is very
uncomfortable, right?

26:25.832 --> 26:27.531
The only negative example

26:27.532 --> 26:29.032
in their minds is Xie Qiang.

26:31.382 --> 26:32.622
But

26:33.142 --> 26:35.552
I think Aunt Feng is also wrong.

26:36.032 --> 26:37.551
Aunt Gui brought her mushrooms,

26:37.552 --> 26:39.461
but she didn't eat them and got angry.

26:39.462 --> 26:41.581
It's your business if
you don't eat, right?

26:41.582 --> 26:44.072
It's kind of people
to give it to you.

26:44.752 --> 26:46.101
Aunt Gui was really

26:46.102 --> 26:47.692
talking about the wrong thing.

26:48.992 --> 26:50.072
What do you mean?

26:51.102 --> 26:54.031
You know Aunt Feng had
a daughter before, right?

26:54.032 --> 26:55.702
Of course.

26:56.102 --> 26:57.561
I heard that some years ago

26:57.562 --> 26:58.831
she went with her classmates

26:58.832 --> 27:00.511
to the mountains to pick wild cherries,

27:00.512 --> 27:02.231
and accidentally fell into the ditch.

27:02.232 --> 27:03.078
Yes.

27:03.102 --> 27:04.791
They went to pick wild cherries.

27:04.792 --> 27:06.222
But Yun fell down

27:06.552 --> 27:07.991
because she saw mushrooms there,

27:07.992 --> 27:09.241
and wanted to pick them.

27:09.242 --> 27:10.471
But it was raining that day,

27:10.472 --> 27:12.731
the soil was loosened,
so she fell down.

27:12.732 --> 27:14.521
But people in the village only knew that

27:14.522 --> 27:15.931
she went to pick wild cherries,

27:15.932 --> 27:17.271
no one knew it was a mushroom.

27:17.272 --> 27:18.621
The students who went with her

27:18.622 --> 27:20.031
told Aunt Feng's family that

27:20.032 --> 27:21.901
she wanted to pick some mushrooms

27:21.902 --> 27:23.572
to sell to subsidize the family.

27:27.512 --> 27:28.592
But

27:29.072 --> 27:30.992
Aunt Gui is so close to Aunt Feng,

27:31.382 --> 27:32.902
does she not know about this?

27:33.472 --> 27:34.591
Aunt Feng is strong.

27:34.592 --> 27:36.791
She didn't say that, how
would the others know?

27:36.792 --> 27:38.142
How do you know?

27:38.662 --> 27:40.231
Xie Qiang told me.

27:40.232 --> 27:40.901
Right.

27:40.902 --> 27:42.772
You and Xie Qiang grew up together.

27:43.422 --> 27:44.631
You take those buns out.

27:44.632 --> 27:45.751
I'll put out the porridge.

27:45.752 --> 27:46.832
Cooked?

27:52.942 --> 27:54.861
It's cold outside.

27:54.862 --> 27:56.592
You guys stay in the house.

27:57.752 --> 27:59.041
Take a good rest these days

27:59.042 --> 28:00.402
to nourish your stomach.

28:03.832 --> 28:05.902
Damai, does your
stomach still hurt?

28:06.862 --> 28:07.942
Much better.

28:08.832 --> 28:09.582
Thank you.

28:09.583 --> 28:10.752
Sorry to trouble you.

28:11.512 --> 28:12.832
Don't say that.

28:13.072 --> 28:15.752
Trouble each other
properly are friends.

28:16.142 --> 28:18.071
No trouble at all,
that's strangers.

28:18.072 --> 28:19.152
Right?

28:20.182 --> 28:21.262
I'm back.

28:21.592 --> 28:22.901
Is there any meal for me?

28:22.902 --> 28:23.182
Yes.

28:23.183 --> 28:24.191
Let me get you a bowl.

28:24.192 --> 28:24.612
Come here.

28:24.612 --> 28:25.692
Have a seat.

28:27.902 --> 28:29.852
So hungry that my stomach is perforated.

28:30.242 --> 28:32.102
I only ate a little cookie for lunch.

28:32.662 --> 28:34.422
It's going too far.

28:34.752 --> 28:36.421
When the cafe is short-staffed,

28:36.422 --> 28:38.072
there are more customers.

28:38.312 --> 28:39.561
So many customers today?

28:39.562 --> 28:41.821
A group of students from
the Academy of Fine Arts

28:41.822 --> 28:42.472
came to sketch.

28:42.473 --> 28:44.021
They said Granny Xiuying's clothes

28:44.022 --> 28:45.991
were beautiful, and
dragged her to be a model,

28:45.992 --> 28:48.181
painting a whole afternoon.

28:48.182 --> 28:49.782
Was Xiaochun not in the cafe?

28:50.182 --> 28:52.551
I worked at the warehouse as Chuchu.

28:52.552 --> 28:54.751
Granny Caiyun took
Chuchu to Xiaguan

28:54.752 --> 28:56.382
for her mother's birthday.

28:57.102 --> 28:59.222
Granny Caiyun is so old,

28:59.512 --> 29:01.112
is her mother still alive?

29:02.182 --> 29:03.621
96 years old.

29:03.622 --> 29:04.711
She plays cards every day.

29:04.712 --> 29:06.161
As long as she wins some money,

29:06.162 --> 29:07.311
she will be very happy.

29:07.312 --> 29:09.312
She even buys snacks for Granny Caiyun.

29:09.862 --> 29:10.942
I tell you,

29:11.142 --> 29:13.421
although Granny
Caiyun is 70 years old,

29:13.422 --> 29:15.941
she has three
brothers older than her.

29:15.942 --> 29:18.902
She is the most favored
daughter of her family.

29:19.622 --> 29:22.711
Whenever her brothers
have anything good to eat,

29:22.712 --> 29:24.021
they even ask their children

29:24.022 --> 29:25.511
to bring it to Granny Caiyun.

29:25.512 --> 29:27.222
She's so lucky.

29:27.582 --> 29:28.511
She is 70 years old,

29:28.512 --> 29:30.311
and still loved by her mom and brothers.

29:30.312 --> 29:31.271
Yes.

29:31.272 --> 29:33.751
Aunt Feng always
says that Granny Caiyun

29:33.752 --> 29:34.522
has the best life

29:34.523 --> 29:36.311
among all the people she's ever met.

29:36.312 --> 29:38.831
If she was half as
lucky as Granny Caiyun,

29:38.832 --> 29:40.971
she would burn incense
and bow down every day.

29:40.972 --> 29:42.282
Is Aunt Feng's life bad?

29:44.102 --> 29:45.462
Her life is too bad.

29:47.552 --> 29:49.142
You can't say that.

29:49.752 --> 29:51.791
Until the last moment,

29:51.792 --> 29:53.472
we can't make such a conclusion.

29:54.072 --> 29:56.171
Aunt Feng and Uncle
Chang are not too old,

29:56.172 --> 29:57.862
and Xie Qiang will soon be out,

29:58.352 --> 30:00.072
their better days are yet to come.

30:00.832 --> 30:01.912
Out?

30:02.272 --> 30:03.552
Is her son in prison?

30:07.582 --> 30:08.711
Here's the thing.

30:08.712 --> 30:09.902
Her son Xie Qiang

30:10.142 --> 30:12.101
and brother and Guanjun

30:12.102 --> 30:13.381
are all childhood friends.

30:13.382 --> 30:14.831
After graduating from high school,

30:14.832 --> 30:15.961
he didn't get into college.

30:15.962 --> 30:17.901
And Aunt Feng told him to re-read.

30:17.902 --> 30:18.991
But he didn't do that.

30:18.992 --> 30:21.861
He found a temporary
job in a company

30:21.862 --> 30:23.581
to guard the warehouse.

30:23.582 --> 30:26.791
At that time, he met a
group of social loafers.

30:26.792 --> 30:28.751
They drank and made trouble every day,

30:28.752 --> 30:30.271
and called each other brothers.

30:30.272 --> 30:31.841
These people knew that

30:31.842 --> 30:33.311
Xie Qiang worked in the warehouse.

30:33.312 --> 30:34.991
So they encouraged him to steal

30:34.992 --> 30:37.581
the steel and cable in the warehouse,

30:37.582 --> 30:39.792
and then took out
as scrap to sell.

30:40.142 --> 30:41.792
I remember that

30:42.512 --> 30:43.592
they were sold for

30:43.972 --> 30:45.421
tens of thousands of yuan.

30:45.422 --> 30:46.451
But in fact,

30:46.452 --> 30:48.352
those are worth hundreds of thousands.

30:49.182 --> 30:51.832
It took more than a
year to be discovered.

30:53.232 --> 30:54.992
Too stupid.

30:57.182 --> 31:00.222
He just went astray.

31:00.552 --> 31:02.272
At that time, they said that

31:02.582 --> 31:03.831
if they paid back the money,

31:03.832 --> 31:05.171
his sentence could be reduced.

31:05.172 --> 31:06.841
Then Aunt Feng and Uncle Chang

31:06.842 --> 31:07.901
went from house to house

31:07.902 --> 31:09.702
in the village to borrow money,

31:09.942 --> 31:11.382
and owed a lot of debt.

31:12.232 --> 31:13.101
Now the old couple

31:13.102 --> 31:15.101
try to save money these years,

31:15.102 --> 31:17.182
and even want to work all day long.

31:18.072 --> 31:20.831
They not only grow
fruit trees in the fields,

31:20.832 --> 31:22.421
but also weave baskets and tie brooms

31:22.422 --> 31:23.581
during their free time.

31:23.582 --> 31:25.062
They're having a hard time.

31:27.232 --> 31:28.511
Let's not talk about this.

31:28.512 --> 31:29.581
Eat well.

31:29.582 --> 31:31.071
Be careful of indigestion.

31:31.072 --> 31:32.592
These buns are good.

31:33.862 --> 31:35.912
I made the stuffing, and Granny made it.

31:36.342 --> 31:37.581
I need to eat more.

31:37.582 --> 31:39.422
They're coming to sketch tomorrow.

31:39.942 --> 31:40.582
I'm well now.

31:40.583 --> 31:42.092
I'll go to the cafe tomorrow.

31:42.932 --> 31:43.901
You don't have to go.

31:43.902 --> 31:45.621
Just have a good rest.

31:45.622 --> 31:46.702
I'm fine.

31:47.312 --> 31:48.702
Damai is more serious.

31:50.832 --> 31:52.291
Luckily I finished the 3,000 words

31:52.292 --> 31:54.702
yesterday before I had an attack.

31:56.142 --> 31:57.992
Is writing more important than life?

31:59.072 --> 32:01.552
As long as I live,
I have to update.

32:03.662 --> 32:05.222
Why am I so tired?

32:07.902 --> 32:09.042
I can't eat anymore.

32:13.272 --> 32:14.352
Eat first.

32:15.072 --> 32:16.152
Okay.

32:22.832 --> 32:24.032
I'm really hungry.

32:37.902 --> 32:39.901
This stovetop shed roof
needs to be repaired.

32:39.902 --> 32:41.312
The soil is falling down.

32:42.382 --> 32:45.072
Wait until we harvest the plums.

32:48.512 --> 32:50.372
When eating, look carefully...

33:07.832 --> 33:09.462
Our agreement.

33:10.902 --> 33:12.181
Good food.

33:12.182 --> 33:13.382
Funny things.

33:13.992 --> 33:14.941
The people I love.

33:14.942 --> 33:16.182
Let it be.

33:17.182 --> 33:18.372
What does this mean?

33:21.872 --> 33:27.872
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

33:28.272 --> 33:33.552
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

33:35.092 --> 33:36.271
[Hei is super cold.]

33:36.272 --> 33:41.552
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

33:42.692 --> 33:43.991
[The people I love. Let it be.]

33:43.992 --> 33:49.462
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

33:51.192 --> 33:57.671
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

33:57.672 --> 34:03.752
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

34:06.172 --> 34:12.252
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

34:12.672 --> 34:18.372
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

34:20.672 --> 34:22.671
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

34:22.672 --> 34:26.852
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

34:27.262 --> 34:33.352
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

34:34.772 --> 34:38.341
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

34:38.342 --> 34:40.021
I don't want to let you go.

34:40.022 --> 34:42.032
Time goes by too fast.

34:42.542 --> 34:43.631
It doesn't matter.

34:43.632 --> 34:45.591
I often go to Changsha on business.

34:45.592 --> 34:48.191
When I go, you have
to treat me to good food.

34:48.192 --> 34:49.591
No problem.

34:49.592 --> 34:50.382
If you go,

34:50.383 --> 34:52.191
I'll take care of all the things for you.

34:52.192 --> 34:53.671
Okay.

34:53.672 --> 34:55.112
When will you go back?

35:04.272 --> 35:05.472
In half a month.

35:06.592 --> 35:07.702
Time is so fast.

35:08.332 --> 35:09.982
You don't want to leave, right?

35:13.462 --> 35:14.662
Actually,

35:14.982 --> 35:16.702
everyone is really nice to you.

35:21.022 --> 35:22.102
I know.

35:23.792 --> 35:24.912
And

35:25.232 --> 35:26.872
the good that you don't know.

35:33.022 --> 35:34.102
Help Damai?

35:35.732 --> 35:36.502
Damai has recently

35:36.503 --> 35:37.931
been considering giving up writing

35:37.932 --> 35:39.142
and getting a job.

35:39.422 --> 35:41.111
In fact, we can all tell that

35:41.112 --> 35:42.941
she is very painful and very torn.

35:42.942 --> 35:44.702
Because she still likes writing.

35:46.062 --> 35:48.411
As her friend, I don't
want to stand by,

35:48.412 --> 35:50.032
and want to give her a push.

35:50.592 --> 35:52.912
What can I do?

35:54.672 --> 35:56.831
Damai is usually very nerdy,

35:56.832 --> 35:58.181
and her schedule is irregular.

35:58.182 --> 35:59.571
Her day and night are reversed.

35:59.572 --> 36:01.021
Especially when she can't write,

36:01.022 --> 36:03.021
she is more likely to
keep herself in the room

36:03.022 --> 36:04.202
in a bad mental state.

36:04.462 --> 36:05.711
Here's what I think.

36:05.712 --> 36:07.541
You two are both creators,

36:07.542 --> 36:09.231
and you can talk together.

36:09.232 --> 36:11.302
You can encourage her more.

36:12.112 --> 36:14.461
At least, let her out
in the sun more often,

36:14.462 --> 36:16.271
which is good for her health.

36:16.272 --> 36:17.912
No problem.

36:19.142 --> 36:21.362
I also have something
to ask Damai for help.

36:21.832 --> 36:24.711
But she's so talented,
why would she give up?

36:24.712 --> 36:25.192
Yes.

36:25.193 --> 36:26.552
You think so too?

36:26.862 --> 36:28.941
Actually, Damai's
writing is really good.

36:28.942 --> 36:30.901
But those comments are so weird.

36:30.902 --> 36:32.782
Like it's not sweet at all.

36:33.082 --> 36:34.381
Suspense and mystery novel,

36:34.382 --> 36:36.011
of course, it's not sweet.

36:36.012 --> 36:37.512
Besides, someone blames that

36:38.062 --> 36:40.151
the mistress had a
five-year relationship,

36:40.152 --> 36:41.341
so disgusting.

36:41.342 --> 36:42.981
I'm so angry.

36:42.982 --> 36:44.751
Someone even denigrates the author.

36:44.752 --> 36:46.151
They say the author must have

36:46.152 --> 36:47.541
psychological problems.

36:47.542 --> 36:49.262
Nonsense.

36:49.632 --> 36:51.782
Don't care about such comments.

36:53.632 --> 36:54.941
Anyway, Hongdou and I think

36:54.942 --> 36:56.592
her writing is really good.

36:57.462 --> 36:58.671
You must read it.

36:58.672 --> 37:00.421
Must read it.

37:00.422 --> 37:01.502
Okay.

37:02.862 --> 37:03.942
Bt the way,

37:04.062 --> 37:07.191
I... I have to ask
for Damai's consent

37:07.192 --> 37:09.302
before sending her column link to you.

37:09.902 --> 37:11.131
Let me ask her first.

37:11.132 --> 37:12.702
It's okay. I'll just ask her.

37:14.022 --> 37:17.591
Remember to tell
her that you really like

37:17.592 --> 37:19.512
suspense and romance novels.

37:20.192 --> 37:21.272
Okay.

37:22.672 --> 37:23.752
Damai,

37:23.942 --> 37:26.662
when you are in trouble,
don't hold on alone.

37:26.982 --> 37:29.182
Sometimes, you can
also rely on friends.

37:56.712 --> 37:57.792
Hongdou.

37:58.462 --> 37:59.542
Hongdou,

37:59.862 --> 38:01.061
are you up?

38:01.062 --> 38:01.981
Wait.

38:01.982 --> 38:03.112
Okay.

38:07.062 --> 38:08.128
What's wrong?

38:08.152 --> 38:09.241
Damai replied to me.

38:09.242 --> 38:10.532
Let me read it to you.

38:11.112 --> 38:12.951
I've read all your comments.

38:12.952 --> 38:14.311
Your encouragement and support

38:14.312 --> 38:15.461
are very important to me.

38:15.462 --> 38:16.751
I will continue to write hard.

38:16.752 --> 38:18.112
Love you and thank you.

38:18.982 --> 38:20.021
So early in the morning,

38:20.022 --> 38:21.381
I thought something was wrong.

38:21.382 --> 38:22.861
She replied to you too.

38:22.862 --> 38:23.721
And she replied to

38:23.722 --> 38:25.381
all the other accounts I registered.

38:25.382 --> 38:27.591
She hasn't read the
comments for a long time.

38:27.592 --> 38:28.981
Now she's reading them again.

38:28.982 --> 38:30.902
And she even updated more yesterday.

38:32.462 --> 38:33.872
Your strategy is great.

38:34.632 --> 38:35.731
From now on, we will be

38:35.732 --> 38:37.151
the most loyal readers of Damai.

38:37.152 --> 38:39.102
We should guard her together silently.

38:47.502 --> 38:48.582
Damai.

38:49.632 --> 38:51.111
Hello. Good morning.

38:51.112 --> 38:52.191
Good morning.

38:52.192 --> 38:53.272
Good morning.

38:53.862 --> 38:56.072
I've been up all
night, and didn't sleep.

38:57.502 --> 38:59.182
Did the writing go well?

39:00.542 --> 39:01.782
I didn't write it out.

39:02.152 --> 39:03.762
Why didn't you write it again?

39:06.192 --> 39:09.271
Because the creation itself

39:09.272 --> 39:11.061
is a combination of self-doubt, tears,

39:11.062 --> 39:12.421
countless late nights

39:12.422 --> 39:14.392
and the occasional flash of insight.

39:15.982 --> 39:18.112
Exactly.

39:19.712 --> 39:20.792
Hu,

39:21.062 --> 39:22.302
have you written it?

39:23.312 --> 39:24.941
Not at all.

39:24.942 --> 39:26.231
Is he okay?

39:26.232 --> 39:28.622
I'm the same as you.

39:53.792 --> 39:54.872
Uncle Chang.

39:55.422 --> 39:56.502
Uncle Chang.

40:02.012 --> 40:03.422
The Fifth Hospital, right?

40:03.752 --> 40:04.191
Okay.

40:04.192 --> 40:05.311
I'm... I'm coming.

40:05.312 --> 40:06.591
I'm coming.

40:06.592 --> 40:07.922
Aunt Feng, what's wrong?

40:08.192 --> 40:09.981
My husband fainted.

40:09.982 --> 40:12.271
I have to go home to
get his ID and money.

40:12.272 --> 40:13.311
Where's my phone?

40:13.312 --> 40:14.432
Here.

40:15.192 --> 40:16.831
Aunt Feng, don't panic.

40:16.832 --> 40:17.811
It may not be serious.

40:17.812 --> 40:19.142
How did he faint?

40:21.232 --> 40:21.942
How did he faint?

40:21.942 --> 40:23.022
I'm...

40:26.422 --> 40:27.782
Arrogant.

40:28.152 --> 40:29.662
I'm not here for you.

40:30.382 --> 40:31.822
I'm here to Baoping.

40:32.902 --> 40:33.982
Chuchu.

40:34.592 --> 40:36.941
Aunt Gui, Uncle Chang fainted.

40:36.942 --> 40:37.921
Aunt Feng was scared.

40:37.922 --> 40:39.541
She went back alone,
can she handle it?

40:39.542 --> 40:40.622
Fainted?

40:41.112 --> 40:42.192
How could?

40:43.272 --> 40:43.871
It's okay.

40:43.872 --> 40:45.072
I'll go check it out.

40:45.472 --> 40:46.501
This is for Baoping.

40:46.502 --> 40:47.671
One is for Feng.

40:47.672 --> 40:48.421
Okay.

40:48.422 --> 40:49.311
Be careful.

40:49.312 --> 40:50.392
Okay.

40:59.312 --> 41:02.302
Feng.

41:03.632 --> 41:05.041
Get on.

41:05.042 --> 41:06.421
Let me take you to the hospital.

41:06.422 --> 41:07.821
I'm going to the Fifth Hospital.

41:07.822 --> 41:08.831
My husband has fainted.

41:08.832 --> 41:09.462
Hurry up.

41:09.462 --> 41:09.902
I know.

41:09.903 --> 41:11.342
Sit still.

41:16.192 --> 41:17.631
Isn't this dangerous?

41:17.632 --> 41:19.191
It's so scary.

41:19.192 --> 41:20.272
Yao.

41:20.982 --> 41:21.831
Aunt Feng, Aunt Gui.

41:21.832 --> 41:22.901
How is my husband?

41:22.902 --> 41:24.111
Uncle Chang is fine.

41:24.112 --> 41:25.791
He's awake, and
in for an infusion.

41:25.792 --> 41:26.872
Okay.

41:28.942 --> 41:30.022
How are you?

41:30.272 --> 41:31.352
I'm fine.

41:31.792 --> 41:32.872
Yao,

41:32.942 --> 41:34.591
your Uncle Chang has fainted.

41:34.592 --> 41:35.751
What did the doctor say?

41:35.752 --> 41:37.341
He is anemic due to malnutrition.

41:37.342 --> 41:39.311
His hemoglobin is only 70 grams.

41:39.312 --> 41:40.472
Is that serious?

41:40.982 --> 41:42.191
Yes, a little serious.

41:42.192 --> 41:43.272
Very serious.

41:43.942 --> 41:46.151
If I hadn't passed
by and seen him,

41:46.152 --> 41:48.751
he was lying there, it
would have been serious.

41:48.752 --> 41:49.301
That's true.

41:49.302 --> 41:50.592
Thanks to Second Bro.

41:51.022 --> 41:52.591
Luckily.

41:52.592 --> 41:53.672
Nothing.

41:54.342 --> 41:55.782
Yao,

41:56.342 --> 41:57.422
I'll leave now.

41:57.592 --> 41:57.921
Okay.

41:57.922 --> 41:58.491
I'm leaving.

41:58.492 --> 41:59.572
Take care.

42:02.712 --> 42:03.792
Don't worry.

42:04.022 --> 42:05.282
You scared me.

42:07.462 --> 42:08.542
Yao,

42:09.192 --> 42:10.311
you stay here.

42:10.312 --> 42:11.261
I'm going back too.

42:11.262 --> 42:12.932
Don't you go in and take a look?

42:15.382 --> 42:16.981
I don't take anything.

42:16.982 --> 42:18.501
I'm too embarrassed to go in.

42:18.502 --> 42:19.822
You stay, I'm leaving.

42:24.112 --> 42:25.702
Where are Gui and Qin's father?

42:26.272 --> 42:27.461
They go back.

42:27.462 --> 42:28.571
Leave?

42:28.572 --> 42:29.751
The doctor also said that

42:29.752 --> 42:31.101
when Uncle Chang gets better,

42:31.102 --> 42:32.761
take him to a big hospital in the city

42:32.762 --> 42:34.191
to do a full body checkup.

42:34.192 --> 42:36.111
Does he need blood supplements?

42:36.112 --> 42:36.631
Yes.

42:36.632 --> 42:37.712
Let me tell you.

42:39.542 --> 42:41.191
Granny, step back a bit.

42:41.192 --> 42:43.432
The spilled oil will burn you.

42:53.982 --> 42:55.062
Turn it over.

43:08.832 --> 43:10.981
Stir-fry green vegetables
with light soy sauce.

43:10.982 --> 43:12.432
But you put dark soy sauce.

43:13.272 --> 43:14.151
It's okay.

43:14.152 --> 43:16.021
That's how we do it in my hometown.

43:16.022 --> 43:17.992
The way you do it in your hometown.

43:19.462 --> 43:21.552
Then put in less salt.

43:22.062 --> 43:23.142
Okay.

43:24.062 --> 43:25.142
Less.

43:27.632 --> 43:28.712
Enough?

43:28.942 --> 43:30.022
Add some more.

43:31.152 --> 43:32.232
Okay.

43:36.672 --> 43:42.142
